{"2417310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ForeVR Cornhole VR", "steam_appid": 2417310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "This year… summer lasts ForeVR!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPick from 50+ unique bags and boards, with classic and creative designs to suit each player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience our custom beanbag physics, tailored for all throws and strategies, and optimised for realism.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself in five stunning halls, with more to come!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRock out to your favourite music and playlists using our YouTube-powered media player, with full multiplayer sync coming soon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n🌽 50+ unique bags &amp; boards to cornhole your way<br />\r\n🌽 5 Halls<br />\r\n🌽 Challengeable NPC Pros in each Hall<br />\r\n🌽 YouTube-powered jukebox<br />\r\n🌽 Private &amp; quick match multiplayer<br />\r\n🌽 2v2 team battles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo matter what you call it, it’s surely the world’s greatest lawn game. ForeVR Cornhole is the best (and first!) cornhole game for VR!", "about_the_game": "This year… summer lasts ForeVR!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPick from 50+ unique bags and boards, with classic and creative designs to suit each player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience our custom beanbag physics, tailored for all throws and strategies, and optimised for realism.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself in five stunning halls, with more to come!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRock out to your favourite music and playlists using our YouTube-powered media player, with full multiplayer sync coming soon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n🌽 50+ unique bags &amp; boards to cornhole your way<br />\r\n🌽 5 Halls<br />\r\n🌽 Challengeable NPC Pros in each Hall<br />\r\n🌽 YouTube-powered jukebox<br />\r\n🌽 Private &amp; quick match multiplayer<br />\r\n🌽 2v2 team battles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo matter what you call it, it’s surely the world’s greatest lawn game. ForeVR Cornhole is the best (and first!) cornhole game for VR!", "short_descri